    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1620">

                <pb facs="1180" n="1064" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg1064"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.51/129.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            French Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 2, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: It affords me pleasure
                    to enclose herewith for your information a copy of a despatch from the American
                    Consul at San Luis Potosí, Mexico, from which I am glad to learn that he was
                    instrumental in obtaining the release of Mr. C. Garcin, a French merchant, who
                    was arrested in that city on June 16, and was liberated on the same day.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1620-a1.xml" xpointer="d1620-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
